Stone--\v{C}ech Compactification}, 2nd ed., de Gruyter, 2012.

\bibitem{Ruzsa1978} I.~Z.~Ruzsa, \emph{On difference sets}, Studia Sci.\ Math.\
Hungar.\ \textbf{13} (1978), 319--326.
