cycles in graphs}, J.\ Combin.\ Theory Ser.~B \textbf{14} (1973), 46--54.

\bibitem{Schur1917} I.~Schur, \emph{\"Uber die Kongruenz
$x^m + y^m \equiv z^m \pmod p$}, Jahresber.\ Deutsch.\ Math.-Verein.\
\textbf{25} (1917), 114--117.

\bibitem{Chung1973} F.~R.~K.~Chung, \emph{On the Ramsey numbers
$N(3,3,\dots,3;2)$}, Discrete Math.\ \textbf{5} (1973), 317--321.

\bibitem{Radziszowski} S.~P.~Radziszowski, \emph{Small Ramsey numbers},
Electron.\ J.\ Combin.\ Dynamic Survey DS1, revision 17 (2021).
\end{thebibliography}

\end{document}
