allgemeinen Reciprocit\"atsgesetzen}, J.\ Reine Angew.\ Math.\ \textbf{44}
(1852), 93--146.

\bibitem{Lucas1878} E.~Lucas, \emph{Th\'eorie des fonctions num\'eriques
simplement p\'eriodiques}, Amer.\ J.\ Math.\ \textbf{1} (1878), 184--240.

\bibitem{JOS1985} H.~Joris, C.~Oestreicher and J.~Steinig, \emph{The greatest
common divisor of certain sets of binomial coefficients}, J.\ Number Theory
\textbf{21} (1985), 101--119.

\bibitem{Granville1997} A.~Granville, \emph{Arithmetic properties of binomial
coefficients I}, in Organic Mathematics, CMS Conf.\ Proc.\ 20, 1997, 253--276.
\end{thebibliography}

\end{document}
""")
